{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-09T21:48:11.963Z","data":{"text":"Task 2 complete.\n\n**Summary of changes:**\n\n- **`src/core/vcs/vcs.ts`** — exported `VcsPushResult`; added `fetchBranch`/`pushBranch` to the `Vcs` port.\n- **`src/core/vcs/git-vcs-remote.ts`** (new) — exact fetch/push argument lists, `FETCH_HEAD` read-back, porcelain `!` + `[rejected]` detection, combined git output on results/errors, tagged with the `version-control` scenarios and ADR 003/014.\n- **`src/core/vcs/git-vcs.ts`** — `runRemote` uses `timeouts.gitRemoteSeconds` with `GIT_TERMINAL_PROMPT=0`; delegates both methods.\n- **`src/core/vcs/no-vcs.ts`** — both fail naming the reason git is off.\n- **`src/core/foundation/config.ts`** — optional `gitRemoteSeconds` on `OsqTimeouts`; `DEFAULT_CONFIG` unchanged.\n- **`src/core/foundation/config-vcs.ts`** — `DEFAULT_GIT_REMOTE_SECONDS = 120`.\n- **`tests/vcs-write.test.ts`** — port members, forbidden arguments, and the new push-outside-remote-module structural case.\n- **`tests/vcs-remote.test.ts`** (new) — bare-repo scenarios plus the timeout bound and `NoVcs`.\n\n**Verification:** task verify (6/6), full TS suite (3615/3615), and `pnpm verify` (typechecks, build, tests, lint) all pass. All touched source files are ≤250 lines and none contains \"skipped\". Result written to `openspec/changes/161-osq-server/.run/results/2.md`."}}
